+ * Rather than only guessing a fixed delay, also wait for async work a CPU
+ * online transition is known to leave running: rcu_barrier() waits for
+ * any RCU callbacks queued during that ONLINE transition to complete,
+ * returning as soon as that is actually true -- near-instant when
+ * nothing is pending, correctly longer when something genuinely still
+ * needs to finish, instead of a fixed guess either way.
