+	rcu_barrier();
+	/*
+	 * Logged unconditionally (even near-zero) rather than only above a
+	 * threshold: whether this is ever the thing actually worth waiting
+	 * for on this hardware is an open question this lab is meant to
+	 * answer, and a string of "0 ms" results is itself the answer.
